The preview window's texture in mixins/shulkerboxtooltip/sprites.rs is
ShulkerBoxTooltip's own (common/src/main/resources/assets/shulkerboxtooltip/
textures/gui/sprites/shulker_box_tooltip.png, MIT), converted to runs of
pixels by tools/sprites.mjs. The texts in mixins/shulkerboxtooltip/lang.rs are
ShulkerBoxTooltip's English and Russian language files (MIT), made by
tools/lang.mjs; the Russian of the eight lines its ru_ru.json lacks is this
port's. The icon in mixins/shulkerboxtooltip/data/icon.png is
ShulkerBoxTooltip's (assets/shulkerboxtooltip/icon.png).

This port rewrites ShulkerBoxTooltip's previews, key hints, tooltip locking,
ender chest synchronization and config screen in Rust for Horizon's native mod
API. It is not affiliated with MisterPeModder, Mojang or Microsoft.
